    <span>The driver also signs, indicating that the handover was performed in accordance with company SOPs</span>
  </li>
  <li style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;">
    <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 3px; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
    <span>Both signatures are scanned and stored electronically for audit purposes</span>
  </li>
</ul>
  </div>
</div>

<p>By following this three‑step protocol, the logistics provider creates a transparent trail that protects both the shipper and the receiver. The daylight re‑inspection ensures visual integrity, the odometer check guarantees mileage accuracy, and the dual signature provides legal proof of delivery condition, reducing disputes and facilitating swift claim resolution if needed.</p>
<p>All records are retained for the statutory period, enabling future reference during warranty claims or resale audits.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


