      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>When hiring a professional packer‑and‑mover to transfer your belongings from Bangalore to Pune, you must provide a set of official documents that prove the vehicle’s compliance, safety, and insurance coverage. These papers protect both you and the transporter from legal disputes and claim complications.</p>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
